meta {
  name: Commit Session
  type: http
  seq: 9
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/v2/scribe_sessions/{{sessionId}}/commit
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

headers {
  Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}
}

docs {
  The canonical billable, idempotent operation: places a quota hold, sets the
  session to `processing`, and enqueues background processing. A duplicate
  commit replays the prior response rather than re-enqueuing (internal
  fingerprint `commit:<session_id>` in addition to the Idempotency-Key header).

  - 202 — serialized session with `status: "processing"`
  - 402 insufficient_credit — quota hold failed
  - 404 session_not_found / 410 session_expired

  After committing, poll Get Session until the HTTP status is 200 or 206.
}
